\
                                                        <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>QUESTIONS</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
                                                            <h2 style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>How long is the session?</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">30 minutes. The session is focused and efficient while still giving you time to relax, get comfortable, and create beautiful images.</p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>How many images do I receive?</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Five fully retouched images of your choice. You'll select your favorites from your gallery after the session.</p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>Can I purchase additional images?</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Yes. Your five images are included. If you fall in love with additional photographs, you'll have the opportunity to purchase them separately.</p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>Do I need to know how to pose?</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Absolutely not. That's part of what you're hiring us for. We'll guide you through poses, movement, expression and positioning throughout your session.</p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>What should I wear?</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">For a Flying Dress Mini Session, your dress becomes part of the experience. We'll guide you through movement and posing so you don't have to worry about knowing what to do.</p>\
                                                            <p style="text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">\
                                                                <strong>What happens if the weather doesn't cooperate?</strong>\
                                                            </p>\
